flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Prepare select account_no and balance]
    B --> C[Open DB connection]
    C --> D[Bind accountNo field and user ID]
    D --> E[Execute query]
    E --> F{Row found?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Return accountNo,balance string]
    F -- No --> H[Return empty string]
    C --> I[On SQL error print stack trace]
    I --> H
    G --> J[End]
    H --> J
